    rdfs:label "102 - BRONZE STATUETTE OF A CHILD. Alexandrine.  Wearing a long clinging garment which falls to the ground.  The hair is coiled in a knot at the back of the head.  Ht., 3 3/8 inches.  From the Sambon collection.(Salein Paris,Ig14.)" ;
