    rdfs:label "33 - LIMESTONE RELIEF. New Kingdom. The principal personnage is Isis, seated; her head is missing, but the long wig falls before and behind the shoulder.She wears jewels at her throat, and a clinging robe. She suckles the infant Horus, on her knee; the royal tress hangs from the side of his head.  Ht.,13 3/4inches;W.,173/4 inches.  (Illustrated.)" ;
