This superb and rare bronze is described and reproduced in Dr.Bode's work,"Die Italienischen Bronzestatuetten der Renaissance"; see pp. 2I, 22, Fig.13, and Pl. XXI.\r
\r
Ht.,10 1/8 inches.\r
\r
(Illustrated.)""" ;
