zac:BO0624_51192_lot_38 a la:Set ;
    rdfs:label "38 - STATUETTE OF A MAN. Middle Kingdom. In Egyptian limestone; cut off below the knee. The style is full of energy. The somewhat brutal face is broad, and the forehead low,. beneath a round, futed wig. The arms fall stiffy beside the body; the left hand is missing, the right is clenched. The torso is nude, wearing the shenti from the waist to the knee." ;
    crm:P102_has_title zac:BO0624_51192_lot_38_title ;
