zac:BO0624_51192_lot_381 a la:Set ;
    rdfs:label "381 - GIOVANNI DA BOLOGNA. 1524-1608.  Fabulous two-legged monster, with fantastic bull-like head, small wings, and cloven hooves. This energetic and important bronze, of surprising imaginative power, is one of the few which have come down to us of this type, in which the master gave free play to his abundant fancy. Brown-green patina." ;
