## 419 BERNARD PALISSY.\r
\r
Oval dish,with hollow compartments, and four graceful figures of cherubs in low relief;polychrome glaze. A beautiful specimen of the art of the celebrated 16th. century French master.\r
\r
From the Seilliere collection. (Sale in Paris,18go.)\r
\r
Length,13 inches.Width,10inches.\r
## 420 BERNARD PALISSY.\r
\r
Round dish : with the legend of Perseus and Andromeda, in low relief. Polychrome glaze.\r
\r
Diameter,9 1/2 inches.\r
## HISPANO-MORESQUE POTTERY""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

