    rdfs:label """436\r
\r
(Illustrated.)\r
\r
— OVAL ENAMEL PLAQUE. Limoges,I3th.century.\r
\r
With a richly engraved and gilt figure of Christ, the head in relief, on a ground of champleve enamel.\r
\r
Ht.,41/4inches.Width,31/4inches.\r
## 7-BEAUTIFUL ENAMEL PLAQUE. 437\r
\r
Limoges,I3th.——I4th.century.\r
\r
Three figures engraved on a champleve enamel background, richly coloured, in lapis, turquoise-blue, green, and red. Below, the inscription : PUGNA, HONOR. DEI.\r
\r
Ht.,5inches.Width,33/4inches.\r
\r
## 438 - END OF AN ENAMEL RELIQUARY.\r
\r
Limoges,I3th.century.\r
\r
Showing the Virgin, with the Child, in a dress engraved and gilt, with the heads in relief, on a richly ornamented champleve ground.\r
\r
Admirably preserved.\r
\r
Ht.,81/2 inches.Width,35/8 inches.\r
\r
(Illustrated.)""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

