    rdfs:label """446 CARVED IVORY PLAQUETTE.\r
\r
Byzantine.\r
\r
Divided into numerous compartments, containing,in high relief, scenes from the life of Christ.\r
\r
Ht.,3 inches.Width,2 4/5 inches.\r
\r
From the Seguin collection.\r
\r
## 447 LARGE CARVED IVORY PLAQUE.\r
\r
Rhenish,gth.century.\r
\r
Representing Christ enthroned, holding a book on the cover of which is a cross, his right hand raised in the act of bene- diction. At each corner, an angel.\r
\r
Ht.,65/8inches.Width,33/4inches.\r
\r
From the Julius Campe collection, Hamburg, (whose stamp it bears on the back).\r
\r
(Illustrated.)\r
## 448\r
\r
—CARVED IVORY OVAL PLAQUE.\r
\r
Rhenish,I2th.century.\r
\r
Christ enthroned. The left side of\r
\r
From a book-cover. the plaque has been damaged, but the figure is intact.\r
\r
Ht.,33/4inches.Width,21/4inches.""" ;
