zac:BO0624_51192_lot_492 a la:Set ;
    rdfs:label "492 - TAPESTRY PANEL. French end of 15th century. Representing the fate of the callous Rich Man. A young man with long fair hair is the central figure of the composition, clad in gorgeous robes, with a damasked cloak lined with ermine.  On the right, the three-headed Cerberus, holding keys, points to the gates of Hades. The ground is strewn with fowers, and in the background is a landscape.A Above, an inscription in Gothic characters, on red ground.  At his feet lies an open casket filled with gems and money. He is urged forward by Pluto (on the left), wearing a crown and a foating drapery, and holding in his right hand a spear." ;
    crm:P102_has_title zac:BO0624_51192_lot_492_title ;
    crm:P138i_has_representation <http://137.204.64.39/image/iiif/3/BO0624_51192!BO0624_51192_001712-p.%20%5B302%5D.jpg/full/max/0/default.jpg> ;
    crm:P1_is_identified_by zac:BO0624_51192_lot_492_id ;
    crm:P67i_is_referred_to_by zac:BO0624_51192_lot_492_description .

