## 5I0-GOTHIC SEAT. French,Louis XII period. C.15oo A.D.\r
\r
Very beautiful seat, of hexagonal shape, decorated with Gothic panels, and three openwork panels with foral design ; the arms supported by two elaborately carved columns.\r
\r
Ht.,28 3/4 inches.Width,22 3/4 inches.Depth,16 inches.\r
\r
(Illustrated.)""" ;
