    rdfs:label "63 - MARBLE HEAD.",
        "63 - MARBLE HEAD. About 500 B.C. A very fine archaic head of Athene,in Parian marble, with traces of earth. A helmet of some other material was pro- bably set on the back of the head.  An important work,representing the transition from archaic art to the art of the 5th.century." ;
