    rdfs:label "88 - BRONZE STATUETTE OF SEATED GRYPHON.  The right paw uplifted. Finely modelled and chiselled. In a state of perfect preservation. Green and brown patina.  An unique specimen of Greek art of the IVth.century B.C.  On a lapis-lazuli base.  Ht.,5 inches.  (Sale in Paris, 1905. No.482  From the P.Philip collection. of the catalogue,illustrated.) From the Fitz Henry collection,London.  (Illustrated.)" ;
