    rdfs:label "98 - SMALL BRONZE STATUETTE. Greco-E gyptian.  A young priest, wearing a pleated tunic, and a drapery passing over his head. The right hand rests with an easy movement on the hip.  Ht.,3 7/8 inches." ;
